== Walkthrough ==

''[[Carver Cagrek]] is located at +378, -455 in Grobb, standing on a platform in the middle of the shaman spell vendors' area, just outside the bank.''

'''Note: This is a simple quest, requiring only 3x [[HEHE Meat]] (purchased from [[Chef Dooga]]) and a [[Tattered Recipe]] dropped by [[Nerbilik]] (Level 20 troll) in the Ocean of Tears. Turn in those four items to Carver Cagrek for a Grobb Cleaver.'''

---

Below here are all the details, including the side quests that bring it all together.

You say, 'Hail, Carver Cagrek' 

: Carver Cagrek Says 'Away from carver Cagrek you get!! Me's a busy troll. Must punish enmees of Grobb and feeds trolls a plenty. Trolls complain meats no good. Dey say dey hears ogres have special meat which taste better den pris'ners of Grobb. Do you knows name of meat? What kinda [meat] dat be? Tell me!!' 

You say, 'HEHE meat' 

: Carver Cagrek says 'HEHE meat!! What dat stand for? Mes need some of dis HEHE meat!! Gos and get me some. Cagrek not just want some. Cagrek want more dan twenny!! Cagrek want three HEHE meat and mes want HEHE recipe. Youg et and me makes _____ honeraree carver. Me gives you Grobb Cleaver. It cut skins like dey butter!!' 

'''Meanwhile, in Oggok, Chef Dooga is at +200, -240, in "Meet and Drink Tew Bie." '''

You say, 'Hail, Chef Dooga' 

: Chef Dooga says 'Welcome you, _____. You look all skin 'n bones. Eat you must do. Chef Dooga can fix up goodies for you. Try [HEHE meat].' 

You say, 'What is HEHE meat?' 

: Chef Dooga says 'It is a secret ground meat made with high elf, human, and Erudite Flesh. Mmmm. It good stuff. Dooga make it and [the Gobbler] make it. If you find any of those meats in the swamps bring to me and I pay you.' 

'''Chef Dooga will not take the more common and universally-dropped Human Parts, High Elf Parts, or Erudite Parts. She will, however, take Human Flesh or High Elf Flesh, which drops from the named cycle in Innothule and Rathe Mountains. Upon handing in Human Flesh (works at indifferent, not at dubious):'''

: Chef Dooga says 'MmmmMmm. Human make good meat pies. Here. A little coins for you.' 

